Cell["\<\
We must then associate to each graph an analytical expression with a \
structure (vertex term) x (propagator term) x ...\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b5ab9dc8-7385-42c3-a422-59f5c9813301"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "prende", " ", "in", " ", "input", " ", "il", " ", "numero", " ", "di", " ",
       "punti", " ", "esterni", " ", "e", " ", "restituisce", " ", "la", " ", 
